🎮 Blender Drumset Game
A fun and interactive drumset game developed using Blender’s game engine. This project allows users to play virtual drums using keyboard controls, combining 3D modeling, animation, and sound design for an engaging musical experience.

Features:
Fully modeled 3D drumset

Responsive keyboard controls

Realistic drum sounds

Smooth user interaction in Blender’s game environment

